B.azl=new A.A("1. GCash & InstaPay Reference Verification\n\u2022 All digital and online payments executed via GCash, InstaPay, or supported bank transfers must be accompanied by an authentic, valid 13-digit transaction reference number and matching screenshot/receipt.\n\u2022 Submitted reference numbers are subject to automated and manual verification by our cashiering and finance staff prior to order finalization.\n\n2. Fraud Prevention & Rejected Payments\n\u2022 Submitting fake, altered, reused, or unverified reference numbers constitutes financial fraud. Orders will be immediately cancelled, and the user account will be permanently blacklisted and reported.\n\u2022 In case of payment mismatch (amount paid is less than total order amount), the order will remain on hold until fully settled.\n\n3. Refund & Cancellation Policy for Online Payments\n\u2022 If an online-paid order is successfully cancelled due to store unavailability or unfulfillable delivery, a refund request will be reviewed and processed back through GCash within 3 to 5 business days.\n\u2022 Refunds are strictly not granted for orders already prepared, dispatched, or completed, nor for customer error during reference number input.\n\n4. Transaction Disputes & Support\n\u2022 For any payment discrepancies, double charges, or failed transactions, customers must contact Bellie\u2019s SmartServe customer support immediately with their transaction screenshot and reference number for prompt auditing.",null,B.auw,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
